## Rows skipped
- sv-a 16 and sv-b 6 (thousands as spaces, "500 000" / "1 579 589"). ACCEPTED-ROUND skips space thousands separators. The checker only groups with "." or ",". Period grouping left as-is in all 18 columns. 0 instances changed.
- sv-a 17 and sv-b 15 (delete U+200B; turn 003 Q16–Q20 into headings). Korean and Swedish ZWSP counts already match (003: 52, 005: 8, 006: 4, 008: 10, 009: 5, 013: 5, 015: 3). Deleting them, or promoting body lines to ## headings, changes the checker block count, ZWSP count, or heading levels. Left in place. 0 instances changed.
- sv-a 19, the other quoted "1"s: "för 1 skadad person och 1 olycka" (003), "per 1 år" (008, two places), "mer än 1 utländsk medborgare" (005). Korean counts those as real quantities (피해자 1명·사고 1건, 1년당, 1명). Only "per 1 dag" → "per dag" (2), because Korean 1일로 is stripped before the number compare. "1 gånger" → "1 gång" keeps 1배.

