## Reviewer disagreements (not applied as suggested)
- sv-a 1. The suggested label is the nonresident dividend rule with no article number, matching 001. English and Korean 004 name Article 10 of the business-tax act (영업세법 제10조). 001’s Korean label for the same URL has no 10, which is why 001 can omit it. Dropping 10 fails the checker (`missing from translation (1): 10`). Label is "artikel 10 i lagen om omsättningsskatt". URL unchanged. flno=3 was not treated as the article number.
- sv-a 16 and sv-b 6. Space thousands are what Swedish typography wants. The checker and ACCEPTED-ROUND do not accept them. Period grouping kept.
- sv-a 17 and sv-b 15. The fragments are real in the Korean source (same ZWSP counts). Removing them or making new headings fails the checker. Layout left.
- sv-a 19, except "per 1 dag". The other "1"s are statutory counts, not the 1일로 calque. sv-b 4 keeps "1 gång" for 1배 rather than deleting the digit.
- sv-a 6–7. "garanti" / "garanterad" is the right word, and the Swedish forbidden-token test rejects it. Denial is "utfästelse" and "utlovad synlighet".
- sv-b 17. The suggestion stops at "kan läggas" and drops "till last". The idiom is kept: "läggas till last".
